# Validation lane

Canonical docs: `.specs/testing/SUBAGENTS-FLOW.md` · `.specs/testing/CONTEXT-BOUNDARIES.md`

When closing a delivery with code changes:

1. `npm run validation-lane:handoff -- --name <slug> --pattern <p> --area <path>` — **coordinator S1**
2. Dispatch **5 parallel** Task subagents (`subagent_type: shell`, `readonly: true`, **model S0** / `composer-2.5-fast`) for roles:
   `lint-build`, `unit`, `integration`, `e2e`, `uat`
3. Each runs only: `npm run validation-lane:runner -- --runner <role> --name <slug> --pattern <p>`
4. `npm run validation-lane:merge -- --name <slug>` — **coordinator S1**
5. Attach `.specs/testing/reports/<date>-<slug>.md` to PR / tracker

**Model routing:** runners = S0; coordinator handoff/merge = S1. See `.specs/testing/MODEL-ROUTING.md`.

**Prohibited:** coordinator running all 5 runners in own shell without Task isolation.

Fast loop (`npm test -- <p>`) allowed during dev; does not replace lane.
